# F6-28 forensic evidence: the same two jobs as "two-streams", plus one tiny kernel
# that resets a counter, launched without a stream argument (stream 0).
scenario with-stream-0-kernel
stream 1 blocking
stream 2 blocking
h2d 1 30 A-in
kernel 1 40 A-kernel
d2h 1 30 A-out
kernel 0 5 resetCounter
h2d 2 30 B-in
kernel 2 40 B-kernel
d2h 2 30 B-out
end

scenario counter-in-stream-2
stream 1 blocking
stream 2 blocking
h2d 1 30 A-in
kernel 1 40 A-kernel
d2h 1 30 A-out
kernel 2 5 resetCounter
h2d 2 30 B-in
kernel 2 40 B-kernel
d2h 2 30 B-out
end

scenario nonblocking-streams
stream 1 nonblocking
stream 2 nonblocking
h2d 1 30 A-in
kernel 1 40 A-kernel
d2h 1 30 A-out
kernel 0 5 resetCounter
h2d 2 30 B-in
kernel 2 40 B-kernel
d2h 2 30 B-out
end
